      "data": {
        "text": "**Considering Authentication Strategy**\n\nI'm currently focused on the implementation plan for user registration, now leaning toward Firebase Authentication as the external provider. I need to make sure this selection is explicit within the `register_user.py` file. I'm considering how this choice impacts the architecture and dependencies of the program.\n\n\n**Defining Firebase Integration**\n\nNow, I'm defining the `register_user.py` file to handle new email/password user accounts. The plan involves a function taking email and password to create a new user via the Firebase Admin SDK. I'll integrate Firebase-specific imports and calls into the code and will assume `firebase_admin` is installed. The primary goal is to ensure the code clearly reflects the use of Firebase as the external authentication provider.\n\n\n",
